Day 7 – Week 1 Project Checkpoint and Progress Review

Objective

The objective of Day 7 was to review the work completed during the first week of the Retail Sales Forecasting project. This checkpoint focused on verifying the dataset, summarizing completed tasks, validating data quality, and ensuring that all preprocessing and forecasting components were ready for the next phase of development.

Project Overview

The Retail Sales Forecasting project aims to analyze historical retail transactions, perform customer segmentation, forecast future demand, and provide business insights using machine learning and deep learning techniques.

